{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_528de8705e784752be8205edc0189def","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_38802e992c323b0c3772365c82c4d3c5228e8cd06ee342b87af5f840288c35e3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"samholt/l2mac@105e74afdc67 snapshot 3bdf23d1d7da66dc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_60cfc51cb39165ef6d320019cf757ed2f0dbefa1ffd316c86393318f2456fd91","slc_650a7524a461aa1bef782383f3fcb98f7fe015092c3ff4f6bb426700fce99bf9"],"source_ids":["src_4a6a47553b785f45bfc693b1bed74c49","src_bf415efb5e1055d583ada98510945b8a"],"text":"The tools_enabled parameter controls which functions agents can use, defaulting to all available tools; for codebase generation, tools include syntax-error checking and running unit tests.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_528de8705e784752be8205edc0189def"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_528de8705e784752be8205edc0189def","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4f6790d79109c2af1a8e29c7601bd75a44033d73a294658db5e635ad3c6277d3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"samholt/l2mac@105e74afdc67 snapshot 3bdf23d1d7da66dc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_64794ca8bad668ee0161ed71925a148e1ea3f250ee361bc5d6d5b399ec008a28","slc_c5b62226c304f088f2e5f8f8fdc7a6b0dac19576dad5762633f28b4353be462f"],"source_ids":["src_bf415efb5e1055d583ada98510945b8a"],"text":"L2MAC reads and updates existing code files created many instruction steps earlier, and generates unit tests used as an error checker to fix code that fails after updates.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_528de8705e784752be8205edc0189def"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_528de8705e784752be8205edc0189def","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_607a9dbacfcca7a49dcae274c51d1466c5b54980d70adbe6f84bcd5c5bfb4eba","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"samholt/l2mac@105e74afdc67 snapshot 3bdf23d1d7da66dc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fe1b66b18b7fdf04f26e02bdd40035d5d2e85abadbd8af3b9486530a2ff517fc"],"source_ids":["src_49df1e30bf5757a4a3b97f525fdd4e75"],"text":"The FAQ notes that any package an LLM agent tries to use must already be installed in the running virtualenv; self-created per-generation virtualenvs are planned on the roadmap.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_528de8705e784752be8205edc0189def"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_528de8705e784752be8205edc0189def","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6e34f0918824d10bbc18e4c655bb9a8208177c37650d5d8786fc358697c5f903","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"samholt/l2mac@105e74afdc67 snapshot 3bdf23d1d7da66dc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_449ed80cc86a3dd6a1dbb8d193dc86ebc5e8d6e659feddca47b017f53e024914"],"source_ids":["src_bf415efb5e1055d583ada98510945b8a"],"text":"Each prompt-program instruction step is loaded into a new LLM agent whose context is managed by a control unit and given tools to read and write a persistent file-store holding final and intermediate outputs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_528de8705e784752be8205edc0189def"}
